{
  "info": {
    "name": "Curso Express JS - Reservations",
    "description": "Endpoints de reservas del curso de Express + Prisma.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Reservations",
      "description": "Endpoints de reservas (Appointment). Todos requieren Bearer token: corré Auth > Login primero para poblar la variable {{token}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (obtener token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el token en la variable de entorno para el resto de la carpeta",
                  "pm.test(\"Login exitoso\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", body.token);",
                  "    console.log(\"Token guardado\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Helper: no es un endpoint de reservations, pero deja el {{token}} listo."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear reserva",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "// Guarda el id para usarlo en Obtener / Actualizar",
                  "if (body.reservation && body.reservation.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"reservationId\", body.reservation.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"timeBlockId\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/reservations\n\nCrea una reserva para el usuario del token (el userId NO se manda en el body).\n\nBody:\n- date (obligatorio): fecha ISO válida\n- timeBlockId (obligatorio): entero positivo, debe existir\n\nRespuestas:\n- 201: reserva creada\n- 400: falta date o timeBlockId, o formato inválido\n- 401: sin token o token inválido\n- 404: el bloque horario no existe\n- 409: ese bloque ya está reservado en esa fecha"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar mis reservas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve total y reservations\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"total\");",
                  "    pm.expect(body.reservations).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/reservations\n\nDevuelve todas las reservas del usuario autenticado, ordenadas por fecha ascendente.\n\nRespuesta: { total, reservations: [...] }\n\n- 200: ok\n- 401: sin token o token inválido"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar mis reservas (filtrar por fecha)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Incluye la fecha filtrada\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property(\"date\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations?date=2026-09-15",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "2026-09-15",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD. Filtra las reservas de ese día (rango UTC 00:00 a 00:00 del día siguiente)."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/reservations?date=YYYY-MM-DD\n\nMismo endpoint que el anterior, acotado a un día.\n\nRespuesta: { date, total, reservations: [...] }\n\n- 200: ok\n- 400: la fecha no tiene un formato válido\n- 401: sin token o token inválido"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener reserva por id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"No expone userId ni password\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.not.have.property(\"userId\");",
                  "    pm.expect(body.user).to.not.have.property(\"password\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations",
                "{{reservationId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/reservations/:id\n\nDevuelve una reserva. Solo el dueño o un ADMIN pueden verla.\n\n- 200: ok\n- 400: el id no es un entero positivo\n- 401: sin token o token inválido\n- 403: la reserva es de otro usuario y no sos ADMIN\n- 404: no existe"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar reserva",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"timeBlockId\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations",
                "{{reservationId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "PUT /api/reservations/:id\n\nActualización parcial: podés mandar date, timeBlockId, o ambos. Los campos ausentes conservan su valor.\n\nSolo el dueño o un ADMIN pueden actualizarla.\n\n- 200: actualizada\n- 400: id inválido, body vacío, o formato inválido\n- 401: sin token o token inválido\n- 403: la reserva es de otro usuario y no sos ADMIN\n- 404: no existe la reserva o el bloque horario\n- 409: el nuevo slot ya está reservado"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar reserva (solo timeBlockId)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"timeBlockId\": 3\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations",
                "{{reservationId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ejemplo de update parcial: cambia solo el bloque horario y mantiene la fecha actual."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userEmail",
      "value": "user@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userPassword",
      "value": "password123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reservationId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
